# Momotarou Densetsu (PS1) text table: u16 little-endian codes (docs/re/text.md).
# 0000-00E6 read by eye (verified on in-game text); 00E7+ and 1xxx kanji: OCR guesses, then (phase 4) every kanji used
# in text compared by eye against its glyph (zoomed sheets) and ~230 misreads fixed with sentence context. Rare
# kanji may still be off; fix here when a translator flags one. Commented lines = unused duplicate/graphic cells.
# 07xx = 8x12 half-width glyphs (digits), 08xx = 8x8 glyphs: listed as [xx] escapes until mapped.
